speechtext:
Resolved, that a sum not exceeding $600,946,640.92 being the aggregate of
(a)	one sixth of the total of the amounts of the items set forth in the main estimates for the fiscal year ending March 31, 1961, laid before the House of Commons at the present session of parliament, $593,558,978.34;
(b)	seven twelfths of the total of the amounts of items 64 and 95 of the said estimates, $350,000;
(c)	one third of the total of the amounts of items 137 and 267 of the said estimates, $565,070;
(d)	one twelfth of the total of the amounts of items 193, 194, 195, 197, 199, 203, 207, 208, 213 and 303 of the said estimates, $1,472,592.58;

(e)	one third of the total of the amount of the item set forth in the supplementary estimates for the fiscal year ending March 31, 1961, laid before the House of Commons at the present session of parliament, $5,000,000,
be granted to Her Majesty on account of the fiscal year ending March 31, 1961.
